#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
s6_sim_2022_bear_backtest.py — 2022 Bear Regime BBD Expectancy Validation

Full calendar year 2022. BBD fired sparsely in the Aug-2025→Apr-2026 180d
window (>90% BULL regime). This script stress-tests BBD against a textbook
bear market (SPY -19%, NASDAQ -33%) with multiple BEAR/CRISIS transitions.

No rule tuning. Exact live BBD config. All 9 S6 agents.

Outputs:
  data/s6_sim_2022_bear_backtest.json
  Console: BBD count/WR/expectancy, regime distribution, top wins/losses, BMB count

Usage:
    venv/bin/python3 scripts/s6_sim_2022_bear_backtest.py
"""
